WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.502
Kip sat down on the bridge.

2
00:00:08.503 --> 00:00:12.656
"This is a horrible day," he thought.

3
00:00:12.657 --> 00:00:16.446
Suddenly— stomp, stomp,

4
00:00:16.447 --> 00:00:23.122
stomp! Kids ran across the

5
00:00:23.123 --> 00:00:28.703
bridge. Kip dived out of the

6
00:00:28.704 --> 00:00:36.213
way. The kids went down the

7
00:00:36.214 --> 00:00:42.114
slide. Kip went back to the

8
00:00:42.115 --> 00:00:44.657
steps. But more kids were

9
00:00:44.658 --> 00:00:47.504
coming. "Oh no!" cried

10
00:00:47.505 --> 00:00:56.355
Kip. Kip ran away from the

11
00:00:56.356 --> 00:01:00.732
steps. Just then some raindrops

12
00:01:00.733 --> 00:01:03.468
fell. Soon it was raining

13
00:01:03.469 --> 00:01:11.402
hard. The kids

14
00:01:11.403 --> 00:01:15.234
left. Kip stood near the slide.

15
00:01:15.235 --> 00:01:21.109
Rain fell on him.

16
00:01:21.110 --> 00:01:24.975
He sighed.

17
00:01:24.976 --> 00:01:28.056
"This is a horrible—whoa!"

18
00:01:28.057 --> 00:01:32.544
Kip slipped and fell down the slide.

19
00:01:32.545 --> 00:01:37.827
Water ran down the slide.

20
00:01:37.828 --> 00:01:41.512
Zoom! Kip flew fast.

21
00:01:41.513 --> 00:01:54.065
"Whee!" cried Kip.

22
00:01:54.066 --> 00:01:59.500
Bird flew to the playground.

23
00:01:59.501 --> 00:02:02.162
Kip was in a puddle near the slide.

24
00:02:02.163 --> 00:02:06.867
"Did you find any perfect acorns?" asked Bird.

25
00:02:06.868 --> 00:02:09.317
"No," said Kip.

26
00:02:09.318 --> 00:02:15.661
"But I found a water slide!

27
00:02:15.662 --> 00:02:23.205
This is a great day!"

